            <ArticleTitle>[Prevention and screening in adults: trends in 2010].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2276, 2278-80, 2282-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article proposes an update on the recommendations for the check-up and the primary and secondary prevention of cancers and cardio-vascular diseases. Indeed, new clinical data led the adaptation and clarification of some of them. The novelties for cancer screening concern mainly colorectal, breast and prostate cancers. Screening for low ankle brachial index is not recommended.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
